{
  "description": "Run a session's command again in place after its agent failed: same id, bib, name and cwd; exit clears. Harness deviation: the login-shell PATH holds an executable claude that exits with code 1 the first time it runs and waits at its prompt after that, and the session's status is failed before the request.",
